      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "question": "Điểm kiểm tra 10 HS: 5,6,7,7,8,8,8,9,9,10. Tính trung bình, trung vị, mốt:",
      "options": [
        "A) TB=7.7, TV=8, M=8",
        "B) TB=8, TV=7.5, M=7",
        "C) TB=7.7, TV=7.5, M=8",
        "D) TB=7.5, TV=8, M=8"
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "solution": "TB=(5+6+7+7+8+8+8+9+9+10)/10=77/10=7.7. TV=(8+8)/2=8. M=8 (3 lần)"
    },
